        ("In 2026, the GDC consulted on replacing the Standards for the Dental Team with…", ["A new Framework for Professionalism", "A licensing exam for all dentists", "The NHS Constitution", "Nothing; it is not changing"], "The GDC says expectations are not being lowered."),
        ("How many principles does the GDC's proposed Framework for Professionalism have?", ["4", "9", "6", "12"], "Four principles supported by expectations and guidance."),
